
# FixO – FacilityOS Pro

**Project Type:** Enterprise Software / Campus Management Platform

**Role:** Product Developer

**Status:** Under Development

## Project Overview

FixO (FacilityOS Pro) is a next-generation facility operations and campus management platform designed to simplify and automate facility management for universities, residential campuses, corporate tech parks and commercial spaces.

The platform aims to bring multiple campus operations into one centralized digital system.

## Core Modules

- Campus and building management
- Student and visitor verification
- Facility complaint management
- Automated maintenance assignment
- Mailroom and courier management
- Sports facility booking
- Service Level Agreement (SLA) escalation management

## Key Objectives

- Simplify campus operations
- Automate facility management workflows
- Improve complaint resolution
- Centralize campus services
- Improve operational transparency

## Development Focus

- System architecture and planning
- User interface and experience
- Database design
- Role-based access management
- Workflow automation
- Backend and frontend integration

## Target Users

- Universities
- Residential campuses
- Corporate technology parks
- Commercial facilities

## Project Status

Currently under development. Features and modules are being planned and implemented progressively.
